{"title":"Stablemaster","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Stablemaster is a trainer — a named <a href=\"#/monster/human\">Human</a> seen at level 1–35.</p>\n      <h2>Wearing</h2><p></p><div class=\"gear-line\"><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>head</i> Straw Hat</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>torso</i> Stable Vest</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>legs</i> Riding Breeches</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>feet</i> Riding Boots</span></div>\n      <h2>Quests</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-runaway-horses\">The Runaways</a> <span class=\"muted\">· level 10</span></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-wispmeyer-the-white-mare\">The White Mare</a> <span class=\"muted\">· level 23</span></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find Stablemaster</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>Underleaf building</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 2×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-1000011028\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wispmeyer\">Wispmeyer</a></li><li>in the wilds around 1729, 1622</li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"stablemaster\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Other named Humans</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/binxonia-guard\">Binxonia Guard</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/mining-trainer\">Mining Trainer</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/ada-fen\">Ada Fen</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/exchange-clerk\">Exchange Clerk</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/banker\">Banker</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/mira\">Mira</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/ellis-pike\">Ellis Pike</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/nessa-holt\">Nessa Holt</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/lumberjack-trainer\">Lumberjack Trainer</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/james-hookman\">James Hookman</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/harbormaster-orla-quayle\">Harborm